Module: @ohos.rpc (RPC通信)
Item: writeRemoteObject
Type: method
Import: import { rpc } from '@kit.IPCKit';
Signature: writeRemoteObject(object: IRemoteObject): void

Description:
序列化远程对象并将其写入 MessageSequence 对象。




Example:
import { hilog } from '@kit.PerformanceAnalysisKit';
import { BusinessError } from '@kit.BasicServicesKit';

class TestRemoteObject extends rpc.RemoteObject {
  constructor(descriptor: string) {
    super(descriptor);
  }
}
let data = rpc.MessageSequence.create();
