Module: @ohos.worker (启动一个Worker)
Item: registerGlobalCallObject
Type: method
Import: import { worker } from '@kit.ArkTS';
Signature: registerGlobalCallObject(instanceName: string, globalCallObject: Object): void

Description:
在宿主线程的ThreadWorker实例上注册一个对象，该对象上的方法可以在Worker线程中被调用，详细介绍请参见 callGlobalCallObjectMethod 。




Example:
//Index.ets
const workerInstance = new worker.ThreadWorker("entry/ets/workers/worker.ets");
class TestObj {
  private message : string = "this is a message from TestObj"
  public getMessage() : string {
    return this.message;
  }
  public getMessageWithInput(str : string) : string {
    return this.message + " with input: " + str;
  }
}
